            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "If we do that, then we need to support (and make it easy) to have _both_ versions of the plugin active at the same time (per-buffer, depending on whether a treesitter parser and queries exist or not), and not just for the near future. That strikes me as _more_ trouble?\n\n(Note that #40225 only applies to a _single_ language, where we can ensure their availability by bundling. That is neither desired nor feasible in general.)",
